SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
    Na 100
    pH 10
SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    Cl 100
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
